<title>GERMANY: Buba revises down German Nov industry output.</title>
<headline>Buba revises down German Nov industry output.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures for German industry output:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT	 Nov 96	 Oct 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.6	     -0.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +0.8	     +0.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    98.7 (99.5)    97.9</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +1.2	     -0.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +1.1	     +0.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    95.7 (96.5)    94.6</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.1	     -1.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +0.6	     +4.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   140.8 (140.2)  140.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
